　よ・・・」{END}

English:
Mach Kid
 Take your best shot, man!
 I dare ya!{END}

Mach Kid
 Weak!
 I LOST!!{END}

Mach Kid
 Heheh, go ahead and try again!
 I'll go even faster next time!{END}

Mach Kid
 What's wrong, man?
