　のか全くわかってねぇんだよ」<wait>{END}

船乗り
「米の輸入は見合わせた方がいい
　のではないかと・・・」{END}

English:
Dandy
 I understand.
 It must be very important to you...{END}

The largest war on the continent
had finally begun, taking place
<speed_0002> on the Valhalla Plains.<wait>{END}

